---
layout: base.njk
description: "Notes on scheduling, cancellations and front-desk work from the team behind Corvel, the text-based booking assistant for clinics and salons."
---
<section class="intro">
	<h1>The Corvel Blog</h1>
	<p class="dek">What we learn from answering a few hundred thousand appointment texts a month: cancellations, waitlists, reminders and the front desk.</p>
</section>

<ul class="post-list">
	{%- for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
	<li>
		<p class="meta"><time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time> · {{ post.data.author }}</p>
		<h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
		<p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
	</li>
	{%- endfor %}
</ul>
